<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-backed suspects are planning attacks on a U.K. air base that hosts U.S. jets in Iraq and are linked to a drone strike that disabled the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, prompting expanded air-defence deployments, a new special security force and an energy police unit to protect pipelines and curb oil smuggling. Iraqi officials are sending a delegation to Lebanon to assist the inquiry into former MP Ahmed al-Alwani’s death, while militia commander plotted an attack on the U.K. base from a Brooklyn jail. Iranian proxies continue low-level attacks on military and energy targets, and a militia leader called Iraq's first Jewish heritage museum a national security threat. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/13/trump-falsely-claims-nobodys-been-killed-iran-war-last-five-months/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bozeman Daily Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOR2pJMGcxSHpMME1IUGV2d1BwU21CRDBzZFFqbmIwNUhuODRvR0xmUVRYQTlnZ2FKdWNkRk1YUjBHX3Jib2pGYzFjTTRGU1NFOTdRTHVBQllUcDZZcUhWaGVKWF90dXFPcFdmbFpkMWtJNy1PaW1DWHB3eUZsUFJKTVBxeGs0T05FaFU3bkVaZnNucVI4OHNaZmItRXlMRHRfc21YMFZVVUtJSUNJeHBmQXZFXzJMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOR3VNcXNSVFVSX2QtWHB4V1poTGlyT0ZxcjlVLUdWXzBlSlpEVlZvZEdMMDdZLVhvdEtxUEJtQ3FkcXBRM1pza2tqam9XaUpEMFRtZDJYRVcyVng4V0M2U2tNendHSmk4cldpZEt0Vm9SY0VtYkJhYTh0ZzlOdnZGRTV5aDF